      "id": "alibaba-b2b-detail-page-visual-planner",
      "name": "详情页策划与生成",
      "enabled": true,
      "kind": "directory",
      "entryName": "alibaba-b2b-detail-page-visual-planner",
      "description": "Plan and optionally generate vertical Alibaba.com B2B product detail-page images from a product keyword, product description, uploaded product image, or image URL. Use when users ask for 国际站详情页、详情图方案、详情页长图、竖版详情图、详情页生图、产品详细介绍、OEM 工厂海报、产品集合、定制服务、合作流程、参数细节、品牌合作、客户好评、证书检测、公司团队展会、生产包装物流或 FAQ 视觉策划。Identify images with see_image, research buyer concerns with web_search, collect product-specific facts with ask_user, and return a Markdown plan of no more than 8 images by default. When a product reference image exists, every product-related output must use image_edit with reference_images to preserve product identity; use image_generate only when no reference image exists. Use alibaba-b2b-image-set-generator for six square product images and alibaba-store-page-campaign-planner for page preview or publishing."
    }
  ]
}
